res.)","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","חותם":"sign, seal, finish / m.s.","היא":"her / it / she","רוקדת":"f.s.","אמא":"mom / mother / mum","שלךָ":"your (sg.masc.) / yours (sg.masc.) / your (m.s)","כן":"yes","הכלב":"the dog","שלילי":"negative","מיץ":"a glass of juice / juice","לה":"her / it (feminine nouns) / she has","מסעדה":"a restaurant / restaurant","שלי":"mine / my","שונא":"m.s.","עונֶה":"m.s. / f.s. / m.s - pres.","לךָ":"to you / you / do you have","אתם":"do you want / you / you are","הגבר":"the man / the man is","שוחֶה":"m.s. / f.s.","שלנו":"our / ours","עם":"who with / with / with whom","הולכת":"go / goes / is going","מגדל":"i, you, he, it (m.s - pres.) / tower","גבוה":"tall, high","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","מחרתיים":"the day after tomorrow / in two days","אוהבת":"like / likes / love","הם":"are / they / they are","שומעים":"m.p.","צבע":"colour","ילדים":"boys / children / kids","לו":"if / if (cond.) / to him","הילדים":"the boys / the children / the kids","רצים":"are running / run / running","רוצות":"want (f.p - pres.)","קופים":"monkey, ape","אוכלים":"are eating / eat / eating","הן":"are / they / they are","אוכלות":"are eating / eat / eating","רכבים":"vehicle","פה":"here (Location) / mouth","ערב":"evening","אנחנו":"we / we are / we (c.p)","עוזרים":"m.p.","ממי":"from who?","להם":"them / they do not have / to them","הולכים":"are going / are walking / go","ברזים":"tap, faucet","עובדים":"m.p.","תפוחים":"apples / apple","לךְ":"to you / you / do you have","לומדים":"m.p.","שואלת":"f.s - pres.","אותה":"her","אומרים":"m.p.","שלום":"hello / hi / peace","עונים":"m.p. / m.p - pres.","שם":"adjective / is putting / name","דבש":"honey","שואל":"m.s - pres.","אותו":"him / it / the same","הזמן":"invite!","תפוח":"an apple / apple","רוצֶה":"want / wants / would like","חולצה":"a shirt / shirt","לובש":"is wearing / wear / wears","אילו":"if / what / which","שותים":"are drinking / drink / drinking","אין":"not has / not have / nothing can be done","משפחה":"family / surname","לי":"I